<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS6" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Decoding in Latent Spaces for Efficient Inference in LLM-based Recommendation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.6 </span>Impact of <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math> on NDCG for L2D-L</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS7" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Decoding in Latent Spaces for Efficient Inference in LLM-based Recommendation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.7 </span>Compared Methods</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
