<section id="A1.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.5 </span>Dataset Statistics</h3>

<div id="A1.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this subsection, we supplement the statistical information of the datasets used in our experiments. Please refer to Table <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ A.5 Dataset Statistics ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Decoding in Latent Spaces for Efficient Inference in LLM-based Recommendation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a></p>
</div>
